" =============================================================================
" vifm configuration -- index
" =============================================================================
"
" This file deliberately contains no settings. Everything lives in config/,
" split by concern, and is sourced in order below. Edit a module and press
" ,c to reload (or run :reload).
"
"   01-options    core behaviour, minimalist TUI, search, trash, history
"   02-ui         view columns, status line, tab line, file-type icons
"   03-filetypes  what Enter/l opens, guarded by executable()
"   04-previews   quick view, driven by scripts/preview
"   05-commands   :user commands, including the fzf pickers
"   06-mappings   key bindings; leader is ","
"   07-marks      marks and per-directory autocommands
"
" $VIFM is set by vifm to this directory. Globs are not expanded by :source,
" so the modules are listed explicitly -- which also fixes their order.
"
" The stock sample config that used to live here is kept verbatim as
" vifmrc.orig (and vifmrc.bak) for reference.

source $VIFM/config/01-options.vifm
source $VIFM/config/02-ui.vifm
source $VIFM/config/03-filetypes.vifm
source $VIFM/config/04-previews.vifm
source $VIFM/config/05-commands.vifm
source $VIFM/config/06-mappings.vifm
source $VIFM/config/07-marks.vifm
